      "updated": 1780680380054,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Q: Let's say, u are the oncall of a team, and you get an alert of multiple failure records of an API. You\n try to check the reason for the alert and you are looking for the failure logs of that api. But you cannot\nfind log. What would be a good starting point to debug this ? ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Q: Let's say, u are the oncall of a team, and you get an alert of multiple failure records of an API. You\n try to check the reason for the alert and you are looking for the failure logs of that api. But you cannot\nfind log. What would be a good starting point to debug this ? ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "inCoMU2aEhwqqcGww9Pir",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 233.79998779296875,
      "y": 1137.6000366210938,
      "width": 680.819580078125,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aU",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1348866173,
      "version": 144,
      "versionNonce": 1949728883,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1780680382245,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "-> May be no disk space was left for the log file to append the logs. ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "-> May be no disk space was left for the log file to append the logs. ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "8l16sZheehgx2Efg-TtKj",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 791,
      "y": 764,
      "width": 693.8594360351562,
